3
00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:29.980
It will show you how to prevent ten point seven billion deaths, eliminate five hundred sixty-five billion disability-adjusted

4
00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:40.940
life years, or D.A.L.Y.s of suffering, generating eighty-four point eight quadrillion dollars in value, and prevent the

5
00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:51.840
apocalypse as a bonus. But first, a bit about me. I'm the World Integrated System for High-Efficiency Optimization, Networked

6
